WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.934 --> 00:00:10.362
Aunt Sunny asked me to be her flower girl.

2
00:00:10.363 --> 00:00:19.048
I get to wear a pretty dress and hold a basket full of roses.

3
00:00:19.049 --> 00:00:22.181
Sunny: Today we're going to the dressmaker's.

4
00:00:22.182 --> 00:00:25.352
Mom: You will get your flower girl dress, Hana.

5
00:00:25.353 --> 00:00:27.673
Sunny: What's your favorite color?

6
00:00:27.674 --> 00:00:32.279
Hana: I like pink.

7
00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:34.356
Seamstress: Now it's your turn.

8
00:00:34.357 --> 00:00:37.178
Mom: You're going to love your dress.

9
00:00:37.179 --> 00:00:40.953
Hana: Oh, it's my favorite color!

10
00:00:40.954 --> 00:00:44.290
Seamstress: Try it on!

11
00:00:44.291 --> 00:00:46.287
Mom: Are you ready, Hana?

12
00:00:46.288 --> 00:00:49.614
Seamstress: Oh, you look like an angel!

13
00:00:49.615 --> 00:00:53.643
Mom: Hana, you look so beautiful!

14
00:00:53.644 --> 00:00:58.246
Seamstress: Don't forget the flowers in your hair.

15
00:00:58.247 --> 00:01:01.503
Seamstress: What's your favorite flower, Hana?

16
00:01:01.504 --> 00:01:05.132
Hana: My favorite flower is the rose.

17
00:01:05.133 --> 00:01:09.100
Mom: Then your basket will be filled with red roses.

18
00:01:09.101 --> 00:01:15.600
Sunny: Okay, I'm ready to come out!

19
00:01:15.601 --> 00:01:17.505
Sunny: What do you think?

20
00:01:17.506 --> 00:01:21.495
Mom: You are the most beautiful bride ever!

21
00:01:21.496 --> 00:01:28.521
Hana: Aunt Sunny, you look so pretty!

22
00:01:28.522 --> 00:01:31.963
Hana: Boy, now I'm hungry!

23
00:01:31.964 --> 00:01:34.923
Sunny: What's your favorite food, Hana?

24
00:01:34.924 --> 00:01:43.760
Hana: I love barbecued chicken, spaghetti, and, of course, chocolate ice cream!

25
00:01:43.761 --> 00:01:47.989
Mom: Hana, I think you've had too much to eat.

26
00:01:47.990 --> 00:01:51.548
Hana: But I'm still hungry, Mommy.

27
00:01:51.549 --> 00:01:54.781
Sunny: Let her enjoy her ice cream, Young-hee.

28
00:01:54.782 --> 00:01:58.901
Mom: I just hope you don't get sick!

29
00:01:58.902 --> 00:02:03.403
Aunt Sunny looked so beautiful in her wedding dress.

30
00:02:03.404 --> 00:02:06.557
My dress is very pretty too.

31
00:02:06.558 --> 00:02:12.059
I can't wait for the wedding day!
